Database Assumptions
Plain Text
1. Short code is unique.
 
2. One analytics record exists for each short code.
 
3. Audit records are append-only.
 
4. URL deletion is not supported.
 
5. Analytics maintains cumulative click count.
 
Indexing Strategy
SQL
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX idx_urls_shortcode
ON urls(short_code);
 
CREATE INDEX idx_analytics_shortcode
ON analytics(short_code);
 
CREATE INDEX idx_workflow_agent
ON workflow_audit(agent_name);

